al feel.\\n- Subtitle Text: \"From Trade Glory to War\" – aligned towards the bottom or split around the central figure.\\n   - Font: A slightly thinner, italicized version to provide contrast.\\n\\n#### Overall Composition:\\n- **Layout**: A balanced composition where the central figure splits the two backgrounds but seamlessly integrates the historical and modern elements.\\n- **Depth**: Use shadows and layering to create a 3D effect, drawing attention to the central figure while maintaining clarity in the background visuals.\\n- **Focus Point**: Ensure that the central figure commands the viewer\\'s attention and is brightly lit or colored, making them naturally drawn to the text and themes surrounding it.\\n\\nThis thumbnail design should engage viewers by effectively combining rich historical visuals with modern-day narratives, all while maintaining an inviting and educational tone that promotes subscriber engagement.',\n",
